{"id": "t034-002", "text": "Coffee with Leon and Hamza. Leon finally handed his notice in, last day is 14 November. Hamza's still applying for grad schemes, has had four rejections and sounds pretty fed up. I should send him that recruiter's details.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for grad schemes", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty fed up", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that recruiter's details", "owner": "p2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t034-004", "text": "Zofia rang. Her mum's having her knee done on 22/10 and she's going up to Leeds for the week to look after her. Her boss has been fine about it. Need to check in with her when she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee done", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t034-005", "text": "Spoke to Magda after the school run. Her husband Victor got the job at the engineering firm, starts Monday. She was so relieved, they'd been worried about money since summer. Don't forget to send them a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the school run"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the engineering firm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since summer"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send them a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t034-011", "text": "Zeynep - loves bouldering, goes three times a week, vegan. Works in HR at the council. Good person to ask about application tips.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes three times a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works in HR at the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Good person to ask about application tips", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t034-029", "text": "Bins out tonight. Tomorrow: bank at 10, then pick up the prescription.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bins out", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tomorrow", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bank", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "10", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up the prescription", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t034-036", "text": "Victor's first week at the firm went well apparently, he loves the team. Magda says he's already been put on a big project. Their son Max turns 7 on Saturday, he wants anything dinosaur.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week at the firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves the team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "put on a big project", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Max", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 7", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants anything dinosaur", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t034-043", "text": "Femi is really struggling with the masters, thinking of deferring. Dmitri says she's been in tears a couple of times. Need to call her this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the masters", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of deferring", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in tears", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t034-048", "text": "Kate said Pickle's surgery went fine and the lump was benign. She's very relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t034-054", "text": "Hassan's review went well, he got the promotion. Leila said they're celebrating with a meal on Friday. Send congrats.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send congrats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t034-056", "text": "Wiremu's leaving do is on 15 March at the Red Lion. He's sold his flat already. Need to get him a leaving card and something kiwi-ish.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sold his flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a leaving card and something kiwi-ish", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t034-060", "text": "Zeynep ran a CV workshop at work today which was really useful. She said she's applying for a senior HR role herself, interview on 2nd of December. Should ask her how it goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for a senior HR role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how it goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
